Licence notice for glad/glad.h
==============================

`glad.h` in this directory is one half of a generated OpenGL loader; the other
half is `src/glad/glad.c`. Neither file carries a licence header or a copyright
line of its own -- only a generator banner reading

    OpenGL loader generated by glad 0.1.28 on Thu Jan 24 14:13:05 2019.

THE FULL LICENCE AND PROVENANCE RECORD FOR BOTH FILES IS AT

    src/glad/LICENSE

and is not duplicated here, so that the two halves cannot drift apart. In
summary, and with all the qualifications that file sets out:

  * The glad GENERATOR is MIT, Copyright (c) 2013-2018 David Herberth (that is
    the copyright line carried by glad's LICENSE at tag v0.1.28, the version
    that produced these files).

  * The GENERATED code is elected by glad's author as any of Public Domain,
    WTFPL or CC0, while the Khronos OpenGL XML registry it is derived from is
    Apache-2.0, Copyright (c) 2013-2018 The Khronos Group Inc. Whether the
    latter reaches through into the output is NOT settled, and neither glad's
    author nor the Khronos registry maintainer would assert it either way.
    OmniSim takes the conservative reading; see src/glad/LICENSE.

  * The generator was run with `--omit-khrplatform`, so no Khronos
    `khrplatform.h` is generated, included or shipped, and its separate notice
    does not arise. There is no `#include <KHR/khrplatform.h>` and no
    `khronos_*` typedef in this header, and no `include/KHR/` directory in this
    tree.

Upstream generator: https://github.com/Dav1dde/glad
